PLACEHOLDER_TFLITE_FILE
This is NOT a valid TensorFlow Lite model. It is a 1 KB stub shipped
on Day 31 so the asset path exists and `Interpreter.fromAsset` can be
exercised against a missing-real-model failure mode.

The real `scream_classifier_v1.tflite` lands in Month 3 once the
backend training team finishes training on the RAVDESS + FSD50K
audio datasets. Until then, Dart code that tries to load this file
will throw an `InvalidModelException`, which the
`TfliteInterpreter.tryLoad()` factory catches and reports as
"placeholder detected — falling back to EnergyStubInterpreter".

Generated: Day 31. Replace with a real `.tflite` binary when ready.
